tloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Norse Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Norse_Shield_850d35.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Furry Club\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Furry_Club_9565ba.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"MammothShearingFactory\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"117\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/MammothShearingFactory_c40ff6.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.86<br/>April 23, 2013</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Mammoth Shearing Factory</b> can be found north of Svargrond, under the ice shelf behind the Formorgar Glacier (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32230,31016,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32230, 31016, 7)</a>). A small tribe of <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witches</a> are using some sort of mind control on <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Giant\">Frost Giants</a> to work for them in a factory where <a href=\"#/wiki/Mammoth\">Mammoths</a> are stripped of their fur.\n</p><p>The cave is shaped like a teddy bear, with the \"head\" portion being sparsely populated by a few <a href=\"#/wiki/Mammoth\">Mammoths</a>, while the lower \"body\" region has a larger mass of all creatures listed. The six <a href=\"#/wiki/Elephant\">Elephants</a> are only found in the southwestern room of the cave. A book can be found in the south eastern end of the cave, after the witches.\n</p><p>To reach the Factory, you have to go down a ramp in the Formorgar Glacier <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32269,31051,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32269, 31051, 5)</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\"><img alt=\"Witch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Witch_f91c69.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witch</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">120</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">105 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">20 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" h